 packing and safety tasks<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"13313\" data-end=\"13360\">Supports Desktop computer, Packing box, and drills<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"13360\" data-end=\"13385\">Several course cycles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"13386\" data-end=\"13550\">\n<td data-start=\"13386\" data-end=\"13418\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Home cable and gadget storage<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"13418\" data-end=\"13444\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Families and home users<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"13444\" data-end=\"13486\">Reduces clutter in drawers and TV areas<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"13486\" data-end=\"13512\">Group by room or device<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"13512\" data-end=\"13550\">Varies with household tech changes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"13551\" data-end=\"13734\">\n<td data-start=\"13551\" data-end=\"13582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Resale and returns packaging<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"13582\" data-end=\"13611\">Refurbishers and resellers<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"13611\" data-end=\"13657\">Protects items during the second or third trips<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"13657\" data-end=\"13699\">Add fresh tape and clear updated labels<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"13699\" data-end=\"13734\">One or two more shipping cycles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Cardboard Computer Accessory Boxes help you store and ship keyboards, mice, cables, headsets, and adapters in a clean, organized way for office setups, gaming rigs, and refurbished PC bundles, and <strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"289\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> supplies these cartons in bulk so you can match sizes, finishes, and print styles with your PC Tower shipping Box, Desktop computer Packing box, Gaming PC shipping box, FedEx computer shipping box, PC cardboard box, and other 